---
import CtaButton from '../CtaButton.astro';
import { CHECKOUT_PATH, PRICE_SHORT_LABEL } from '../../config/site';
---
<section class="emo-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>UMA FOTO DIFERENTE PRA <span class="amarelo">GUARDAR, POSTAR E MOSTRAR.</span></h2>
    <p>Por R$ 13, você transforma uma foto comum em uma montagem personalizada para guardar, usar no perfil ou compartilhar com quem quiser.</p>
    <CtaButton href={CHECKOUT_PATH} arrow>Quero minha foto por {PRICE_SHORT_LABEL}</CtaButton>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .emo-section{
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.06), transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(160deg, #3a0303, #1f0202);
    padding: 56px 0 52px;
    text-align:center;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,201,60,0.15);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,201,60,0.15);
  }
  .emo-section h2{
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--branco-puro);
    max-width: 340px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
  }
  .emo-section p{
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--texto-claro);
    opacity:0.88;
    max-width: 340px;
    margin: 0 auto 30px;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .emo-section :global(.btn-primary){ max-width: 340px; margin:0 auto; }
  @media(min-width:900px){
    .emo-section h2{ font-size:36px; max-width:600px; }
    .emo-section p{ max-width:520px; font-size:17px; }
  }
</style>
